# 26.7: kernel DKMS source trees (mali/panthor/vpu/npu) are committed, but
# the in-tree build artifacts produced during .ko generation (intermediate
# .o, .cmd, .mod, Module.symvers, Makefile-local) are not. Rebuild from
# any commit with `bash build/build-kernel-debs.sh`.
# Keep this pattern narrow so it doesn't accidentally match the .ko files
# in the kver-overlay directories (e.g. mali/7.2.0-sky1-ncz/mali_kbase.ko
